  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;is the radius of the circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;is the radius of the circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now we know that equation of circle is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, where radius is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,</p><p>On comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, we get</p><p>Radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mtext>given</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}